ti-User Environments: Public or private rooms with multiple participants and real-time interaction.\n\nTraining and Simulation: Virtual scenarios for practical, collaborative, or individual training.\n\nEvaluation and Metrics: Recording and analysis of each participant's performance, actions, and interaction.\n\nReal-Time Communication: Voice and interactive tools for a collaborative experience.\n\nInstructor Management: Control, supervision, and management of training sessions.\n\nScalability: Ability to implement and replicate training experiences for multiple groups and locations.", "short_description": "SAFE HUB is an immersive, multi-user training platform for Meta Quest headsets that enables companies to train, simulate, and evaluate their workforce in interactive virtual environments in a scalable and collaborative way.\n\nSAFE HUB es una plataforma de capacitaci\u00f3n inmersiva y multiusuario para visores Meta Quest, que permite a las empresas entrenar, simular y evaluar a sus trabajadores en entornos virtuales interactivos, de forma escalable y colaborativa."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalexperience.cl/pdf/Politicas_De_Privacidad_SAFE_HUB.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DE SPA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://digitalexperience.cl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_CL", "es_AR", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es", "es_VE"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_